<description>&lt;p&gt;Security forces in Manipur continue large-scale operations, seizing arms, grenades, ammunition, narcotics and a Kuki-Zo insurgent camp while reviewing border fencing and joint grids. Deputy chief ministers are at odds after one linked the other’s husband’s outfit to the killing of six Nagas, and a Naga killings row has prompted calls for one deputy CM to step down. In Jammu and Kashmir the lieutenant governor chaired a unified headquarters meeting on district security and ordered strengthened cyber security across all departments. A truck collision killed its driver in Ramban and two people were buried alive by a sand mound in Baramulla. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxNSUR5NnptdGZkR2ZQZ3ktUWg2dG8tWExIOVJMVWJOS2FyOFJYbEU0MXJpbEtNanp3bHdYSy1IZDVFdThIR1o1MGEzZlJZUko1SGtBZ0VUaUhoVUZPTDByZm1WdEZFLXZ5VE0zakh4dzBhMDRqOHNRNGpXQ3JxVEx3dVdSM21Iank3MU1EWE53M09jSFZyX1BYbw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sri Lanka Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxOdzA2TVViMm1RaVJnb1pBdXdJM1V1NmpGUF9XSWhVc184aUtia0o0WDRTRll4dFhnYXlEZndlUUUwWC1JcjdMY3NQdnVMaUtTYzNwOVFrcld1b3lKYlFrWDB6bU9RN09jSlFXb21KZExwWWVtMFhra3ZFdEdleVdXTWNaS29PLWN1RldOekx4eldZZUxHMkd1QW9BNldRVjU2bl9vbA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Northeast Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;India Today NE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMid0FVX3lxTFAwNTZtcU1ZamRudVlsYk0wYnBhbDN1OHNvamR5RXMzNS0zeS1MSVdTWFJRQ1JtbktjaGxVcUdFTnlSOFNPWmdnY0VpeG1FYjJBclBfeC03REF2UWNGTFB6Y1FKOHg4YlJYQktYaHZtU1ZKVFBPVTFV?oc=5&quot;&gt;Munsif News 24x7&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Rediff&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ThePrint&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a h